            <section class="s_mumtaz_faq o_mumtaz_site o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_mumtaz_faq" data-name="FAQ" id="mumtaz_faq">
  <div class="container mumtaz_faq_wrap">
    <div class="mumtaz_section_intro"><p class="mumtaz_eyebrow mumtaz_eyebrow_dark">FAQ</p><h2>Questions, answered.</h2></div>
    <div class="accordion mumtaz_faq_acc" id="mumtaz_faq_acc">
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h1"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c1">Is E-Invoicing really free forever?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h1" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. UAE VAT, ZATCA Phase 2, and FBR e-invoicing are permanently free for every Mumtaz business. No trial period, no credit card, no catch.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h2"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c2">How does the accounting module work?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h2" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">It is Odoo 19’s standard double-entry accounting — full P&amp;L, balance sheet, bank reconciliation, multi-currency, aged payables and receivables. Activate it in one click from app.mumtaz.digital for $20/month.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h3"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c3">How is Mumtaz different from Odoo Enterprise?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h3" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Mumtaz is built on Odoo 19 Community — open source, zero per-user licensing. We added compliance, an AI CFO, and a marketplace on top, at a fraction of Odoo Enterprise’s cost.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h4"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c4">Is my data isolated from other companies?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h4" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. Every business gets its own PostgreSQL database. Your data never touches another tenant’s data at the database level — erp.mumtaz.digital routes you exclusively to your own database.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h5"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c5">How does white-labelling work?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h5" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Your SMEs see your brand, your domain, your pricing. We provision the underlying Odoo platform. Your dashboard in app.mumtaz.digital shows your entire SME network — their billing, modules, and status.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h6"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c6">Can I activate and deactivate modules anytime?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h6" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. Every module is managed from app.mumtaz.digital. Adding a module installs it instantly; removing it suspends access without deleting your data.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h7"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c7">What is ZAKI AI CFO?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h7" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">ZAKI connects to your Odoo, reviews your numbers overnight, and delivers a 60-second spoken briefing every morning — using your first name and specific figures, not generic advice.</div></div></div>
      <div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header" id="mumtaz_faq_h8"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mumtaz_faq_c8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mumtaz_faq_c8">Can I cancel anytime?</button></h3><div id="mumtaz_faq_c8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="mumtaz_faq_h8" data-bs-parent="#mumtaz_faq_acc"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. Monthly billing, cancel from app.mumtaz.digital. Your data is fully exportable and held for 90 days post-cancellation.</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
